hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"218","[AI-translation] Allah sab se bada hai [teen bar]. Pak woh jis ne hamare liye yeh musakhkhar kiya; hum is ki taqat na rakhte the; beshak apne Rab ki taraf lautne wale hain. Ae Allah! Is safar mein Tujhse neki-taqwa, teri pasand ka amal mangte hain. Ae Allah! Yeh safar hum par aasan kar, doori lapet de. Ae Allah! Safar mein sathi, ahal mein khaleefa Tu hi hai. Ae Allah! Safar ki mashaqqat, bure manzar, maal-ahal mein buri wapsi se teri panah chahta hun. [Wapsi mein is mein izafa kare: lautne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki tareef karne wale.] [Safar par nikalkar padhe]"
